    <bf:tableOfContents>
      <bf:TableOfContents>
	<rdfs:label>[v. 1] Overture ; Oh, what a beautiful mornin' ; Surrey with the fringe on top ; Kansas City ; I cain't say no ; Many a new day ; People will say we're in love ; Pore Jud is daid ; Out of my dreams ; All er nothin' ; Oklahoma ; Finale -- v. 2. Lonely room ; It's a scandal ; The farmer and the cowman.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:TableOfContents>
    </bf:tableOfContents>
    <bf:note>
      <bf:Note>
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/mnotetype/participants"/>
	<rdfs:label>Alfred Drake ; Joan Roberts, Howard da Silva, Cleste Holm, Lee Dixon (v. 1) ; Joseph Buloff, Betty Garde, Ralph Riggs (v. 2) ; with chorus and orchestra conducted by Jay Blackton.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Note>
    </bf:note>
